Unpaid CEO: Hey, new kid. Lesson zero is free. A delivery app needs a rider right now. Take the gig. #line:ch1_onboarding_01
Unpaid CEO: Forty bucks. That's revenue, money that came in. Profit is what's left after the bike, the phone and the taxes. #line:ch1_onboarding_02
Unpaid CEO: Now tap Next week. The city sends the first bills, and we'll see what you really keep. #line:ch1_onboarding_03
